OL,3,ADolly Parton, country music icon and
OL,4,Alegendary philanthropist, dies aged 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FElton John says Parton was "unique and
OL,7,Firreplaceable", while US country star
OL,8,FReba McEntire pays tribute to "my buddy
OL,9,FDolly": "There will never ever be
OL,10,Fanother you"
OL,12,FParton's style was unapologetically
OL,13,Fbold, she wowed Glastonbury, starred in
OL,14,Fwell-known films and appealed to all
OL,15,Fages
